<title>INDONESIA: Matahari '96 net falls to 15.1 bln rph.</title>
<headline>Matahari '96 net falls to 15.1 bln rph.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian retailer PT Matahari Putra Prima said on Monday its 1996 net profit fell to 15.1 billion rupiah against its 1995 net profit of 38.8 billion rupiah.</p>
<p>Matahari said it posted 1.9 trillion rupiah sales in 1996, against 1.4 trillion rupiah in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
